  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation EU-VN Promoting Circular Economy in the  Industrial Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Action aims to support Viet Nam to develop a climate neutral, responsible, circular economy. It is designed to achieve the following specific objectives:-Specific objective 1: To improve the regulatory framework and business environment for the uptake of circular and responsible economy practices.-Specific objective 2: To improve the circularity in industrial businesses and industrial parks.</narrative>
  </description>
